\p \v 40 \rb Additionally, Huram|חִיר֔וֹם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb made|וַיַּ֣עַשׂ\rb* \rb the pots|הַ֨כִּיֹּר֔וֹת\rb*,\f + \fr 7:40 \ft Many Hebrew manuscripts, LXX, Syriac, and Vulgate (see also verse 45 and 2 Chronicles 4:11); many other Hebrew manuscripts \fqa basins\f*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb shovels|הַיָּעִ֖ים\rb*,\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb and sprinkling bowls|הַמִּזְרָק֑וֹת\rb*.
