\li1 \rb and the gold|זָהָֽב׃פ\rb* \rb hinges|וְהַפֹּת֡וֹת\rb* \rb for the doors|לְדַלְתוֹת֩\rb* \rb of the inner|הַפְּנִימִ֜י\rb* \rb temple|הַבַּ֨יִת\rb* \rb (that is, the Most Holy Place|לְקֹ֣דֶשׁ\rb*\rb |הַקֳּדָשִׁ֗ים\rb*\f + \fr 7:50 \ft Or \fqa the Holy of Holies\f*) \rb as well as for the doors|לְדַלְתֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the main hall|הַבַּ֛יִת\rb* \rb of the temple|לַהֵיכָ֖ל\rb*.
\p \v 51 \rb So all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the work|הַמְּלָאכָ֔ה\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb King|הַמֶּ֥לֶךְ\rb* \rb Solomon|שְׁלֹמֹ֖ה\rb* \rb had performed|עָשָׂ֛ה\rb* \rb for the house|בֵּ֣ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb was completed|וַתִּשְׁלַם֙\rb*.
\p \rb Then Solomon|שְׁלֹמֹ֜ה\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb brought in the items|וַיָּבֵ֨א\rb* \rb his father|אָבִ֗יו\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb David|דָּוִ֣ד\rb* \rb had dedicated|קָדְשֵׁ֣י׀\rb*— \rb the silver|הַכֶּ֤סֶף\rb*,\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb the gold|הַזָּהָב֙\rb*, \rb and|וְאֶת־\rb* \rb the furnishings|הַכֵּלִ֔ים\rb*— \rb and he placed them|נָתַ֕ן\rb* \rb in the treasuries|בְּאֹצְר֖וֹת\rb* \rb of the house|בֵּ֥ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָֽה׃פ\rb*.
